    <item>
      <title>When? v1.17.0</title>
      <link>https://play-when.com</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">when-v1.17.0</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Features</h3><br/><br/><ul><li>add images to the curated theme events (<a href="https://github.com/Edward-Muir/when/commit/0f52954f7d85588ea744af2151e7a26c57346092">0f52954</a>)</li> <li>add the curated theme bank with illustrated events (<a href="https://github.com/Edward-Muir/when/commit/761ede564f6eda66fe57ff1f9d036600c17fcb73">761ede5</a>)</li> <li>**events:** add themes.json for curated-theme events (<a href="https://github.com/Edward-Muir/when/commit/6a1d4c3405af3c4b939e8dfcdab15e29fdb2a5eb">6a1d4c3</a>)</li> <li>**themes:** add ciphers, games, cosmic-ideas and the remaining decks (<a href="https://github.com/Edward-Muir/when/commit/f50b0a5a6d0ff0902d8043dd79f382eff1ad34fb">f50b0a5</a>)</li> <li>**themes:** add money and what-we-drink decks (<a href="https://github.com/Edward-Muir/when/commit/2379e7ee61fffbecc55a62c774feb3f0255741b3">2379e7e</a>)</li> <li>**themes:** add plagues, clockwork, automata and assassinations decks (<a href="https://github.com/Edward-Muir/when/commit/f1218b02a540fad53cc2e852b48c4f02dc5bc037">f1218b0</a>)</li> <li>**themes:** add the eureka deck, completing nineteen themes (<a href="https://github.com/Edward-Muir/when/commit/cd7acf55a7817dbff7fb3e5af38a0e7037f2b59b">cd7acf5</a>)</li> <li>**themes:** project theme gates over un-illustrated events (<a href="https://github.com/Edward-Muir/when/commit/50c6e4db67eff5f1d6c016d43335d9134aed1329">50c6e4d</a>)</li></ul><br/><br/><h3>Bug Fixes</h3><br/><br/><ul><li>**art:** emit the five-column prompt CSV the pipeline actually reads (<a href="https://github.com/Edward-Muir/when/commit/c1a88739923a061d3026edb3b48291e968598ece">c1a8873</a>)</li> <li>**scripts:** stop find-duplicates crashing on a larger catalogue (<a href="https://github.com/Edward-Muir/when/commit/450eccbe75e8124ea21b85201752546d1751d04f">450eccb</a>)</li> <li>**themes:** drop two events that duplicated existing cards (<a href="https://github.com/Edward-Muir/when/commit/3924ef26d08d6cef40a37828132e81a06e16ccbb">3924ef2</a>)</li></ul>]]></description>
    </item>
